     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Hello Phil,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">I’m trying to fit a\r\nhigher-order IRT model but I cannot find a programme or package to fit this\r\nmodel. Rijmen (2010) wrote:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&quot;Indeed, most interestingly, some further\r\nalgebraic manipulations of Equation 6 clearly show that the second order model\r\nis formally equivalent to the testlet model,…” (p.366).</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">I was wondering if I\r\ncould fit the testlet model with mirt and interpret it as a standard higher order model. Thanks for your advice.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Regards</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Afshin</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></p><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Afshin Khosravi, PhD TEFL, MA TEFL, <div><div><div><div><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
